Package: planner
Version: @VERSION@
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: @ARCH@
Depends: @DEPENDS@
Maintainer: Matthew Hagrelius <matthew@hagreli.us>
Homepage: https://github.com/hagrelius/planner
Description: Task planner for the GNOME desktop
 Planner keeps track of what needs doing, on your own machine, in one
 plain JSON file you can read and back up.
 .
 Tasks are typed on one line: dates in plain English, repeats, projects,
 sections, labels, priorities and reminders. Views are filter queries, so
 the built-in ones and your own saved filters work the same way.
